{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"eebdff44-21ca-495a-a734-0853a773bea2","agentId":"abd0d088248413ba4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Quick audit (10 min): 验证 Anthropic Claude Max 20x 订阅 ($200/月) 跟 API 的关系，决定 P2 #14 PoC 能否直接用订阅跑而不需另买 API credits。\n\n## 待 verify 的关键问题\n\n(1) Anthropic Claude Max 20x 计划 ($200/月) **是否包含 API credits**? \n    - 是 web/desktop only 订阅, API 完全分开 billing?\n    - 还是 Max 订阅赠送 $X API credits / 月?\n    - 还是某种混合 (订阅 quota 在 web/desktop, API 调用扣订阅金额)?\n\n(2) Anthropic Max 用户**怎么生成可用于 API 的 key**? \n    - console.anthropic.com 单独 organization?\n    - Claude.ai 账号直接通用?\n    - Pro/Max 跟 console.anthropic.com 是否同账号?\n\n(3) **500 iter PoC 成本估算**:\n    - 假设每 iter ~10K input tokens + 5K output tokens\n    - Opus 4.7 当前 API 价 (per 百万 token): input $X / output $Y\n    - 500 iter 总成本估算 (有 prompt cache 90% off 的话考虑下)\n    - **如果 Max 订阅含 API credits, 500 iter 能 cover 吗? 还需补多少?**\n\n## 上次 R13 audit 漏的细节\n\nR13 audit `ae3860a1dc6cbabb8` 验证 CPMpy 0.10.0 / OR-Tools 9.15 兼容时只看 README claim, 没 verify pip install (实际 pyproject 限 ortools<=9.14, 必须 --no-deps), 是 R13 第 5 个 PARTIALLY 翻盘点.\n\n这次 audit 跟那个同款风险——agent 可能 trust Anthropic 营销页 \"Max 订阅 5x/20x quota\" 而没 verify \"API 是否共享\" \"实际 credits 多少\" 这些 detail.\n\n## Audit 任务\n\nWebFetch / WebSearch 查 (按重要性):\n\n1. **Anthropic 官方 plan 页**: WebFetch https://www.anthropic.com/pricing\n   - Max Plan 明细\n   - 是否提到 \"API access\" / \"API credits\"\n   - 5x/20x 是 web/desktop 还是含 API\n\n2. **Anthropic Help Center / FAQ**: WebSearch \"Anthropic Max plan API access credits\"\n   - 找官方 Q&A 关于 Max 跟 API 的关系\n\n3. **console.anthropic.com 入口**: WebFetch console.anthropic.com 看登录是否提到 Max 用户怎么用\n\n4. **当前 API 价格**: WebFetch 官方 pricing page 看 Opus 4.7 当前价\n\n5. **2025-2026 政策变化**: search \"Anthropic Max API credits 2026\" 看是否有最近的 announcement\n\n## 输出格式 (不超过 500 字, 中文)\n\n```\n## Max 20x 订阅跟 API 的关系\n- Max 订阅范围: web / desktop / Claude Code / API 哪些\n- API access 方式: [独立账号 / 共享 / 含 credits]\n- 5x/20x quota 含义: [web only / 跨 product / 跨 API]\n\n## API 生成 key 路径\n- Max 用户去哪儿生成 API key\n- Max 跟 console.anthropic.com 账号关系\n\n## 500 iter PoC 成本估算\n- Opus 4.7 当前 API 价 input/output per M tok\n- 500 iter 总估算 (无 cache): $X\n- 有 prompt cache 90% off 估算: $Y\n- Max 订阅含 API credits 数量: [$Z / 月 / 无]\n- 结论: Max 订阅能 cover 500 iter? [yes / no, need extra $W]\n\n## verdict\n- 直接用 Max 订阅跑 OpenEvolve 500 iter: [可行 / 需要补 $X / 完全分开]\n- 推荐路径: [1. Max API credits / 2. 单独 buy / 3. 走 Agent tool 替代 / 其他]\n```\n\n## 操作准则\n\n- 必须 WebFetch 实际官方页, 不要凭训练数据\n- Anthropic 政策变化频繁, 信息源要 2025-2026 年\n- 如 Max API credits 政策不明确, **明确说\"找不到官方说明\"**而不是猜\n- 简洁\n\n开始。"},"uuid":"589f9d08-f829-429f-934a-36fadb397d66","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:28:35.026Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"589f9d08-f829-429f-934a-36fadb397d66","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"abd0d088248413ba4","attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_delta","addedNames":["CronCreate","CronDelete","CronList","EnterWorktree","ExitWorktree","Monitor","NotebookEdit","PushNotification","RemoteTrigger","TaskCreate","TaskGet","TaskList","TaskStop","TaskUpdate","WebFetch","WebSearch"],"addedLines":["CronCreate","CronDelete","CronList","EnterWorktree","ExitWorktree","Monitor","NotebookEdit","PushNotification","RemoteTrigger","TaskCreate","TaskGet","TaskList","TaskStop","TaskUpdate","WebFetch","WebSearch"],"removedNames":[],"readdedNames":[]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"0f0e8da8-a63a-48fc-800c-5eec37434c61","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:28:35.027Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"0f0e8da8-a63a-48fc-800c-5eec37434c61","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"abd0d088248413ba4","attachment":{"type":"skill_listing","content":"- update-config: Use this skill to configure the Claude Code harness via settings.json. Automated behaviors (\"from now on when X\", \"each time X\", \"whenever X\", \"before/after X\") require hooks configured in settings.json - the harness executes these, not Claude, so memory/preferences cannot fulfill them. Also use for: permissions (\"allow X\", \"add permission\", \"move permission to\"), env vars (\"set X=Y\"), hook troubleshooting, or any changes to settings.json/settings.local.json files. Examples: \"allow npm commands\", \"add bq permission to global settings\", \"move permission to user settings\", \"set DEBUG=true\", \"when claude stops show X\". For simple settings like theme/model, suggest the /config command.\n- keybindings-help: Use when the user wants to customize keyboard shortcuts, rebind keys, add chord bindings, or modify ~/.claude/keybindings.json. Examples: \"rebind ctrl+s\", \"add a chord shortcut\", \"change the submit key\", \"customize keybindings\".\n- simplify: Review changed code for reuse, quality, and efficiency, then fix any issues found.\n- fewer-permission-prompts: Scan your transcripts for common read-only Bash and MCP tool calls, then add a prioritized allowlist to project .claude/settings.json to reduce permission prompts.\n- loop: Run a prompt or slash command on a recurring interval (e.g. /loop 5m /foo). Omit the interval to let the model self-pace. - When the user wants to set up a recurring task, poll for status, or run something repeatedly on an interval (e.g. \"check the deploy every 5 minutes\", \"keep running /babysit-prs\"). Do NOT invoke for one-off tasks.\n- schedule: Create, update, list, or run scheduled remote agents (routines) that execute on a cron schedule. - When the user wants to schedule a recurring remote agent, set up automated tasks, create a cron job for Claude Code, or manage their scheduled agents/routines. Also use when the user wants a one-time scheduled run (\"run this once at 3pm\", \"remind me to check X tomorrow\").\n- claude-api: Build, debug, and optimize Claude API / Anthropic SDK apps. Apps built with this skill should include prompt caching. Also handles migrating existing Claude API code between Claude model versions (4.5 → 4.6, 4.6 → 4.7, retired-model replacements).\nTRIGGER when: code imports `anthropic`/`@anthropic-ai/sdk`; user asks for the Claude API, Anthropic SDK, or Managed Agents; user adds/modifies/tunes a Claude feature (caching, thinking, compaction, tool use, batch, files, citations, memory) or model (Opus/Sonnet/Haiku) in a file; questions about prompt caching / cache hit rate in an Anthropic SDK project.\nSKIP: file imports `openai`/other-provider SDK, filename like `*-openai.py`/`*-generic.py`, provider-neutral code, general programming/ML.\n- init: Initialize a new CLAUDE.md file with codebase documentation\n- review: Review a pull request\n- security-review: Complete a security review of the pending changes on the current branch","skillCount":10,"isInitial":true},"type":"attachment","uuid":"a7f566e9-0d35-4a37-9e5e-0948da671e7e","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:28:35.028Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
