{"parentUuid":"33b0cf04-290d-448e-8009-e809d2b146c3","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"eebdff44-21ca-495a-a734-0853a773bea2","agentId":"abd0d088248413ba4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WqNkyD2F2YCHSAtksq3qWC","type":"tool_result","content":"REDIRECT DETECTED: The URL redirects to a different host.\n\nOriginal URL: https://www.anthropic.com/pricing\nRedirect URL: https://claude.com/pricing\nStatus: 301 Moved Permanently\n\nTo complete your request, I need to fetch content from the redirected URL. Please use WebFetch again with these parameters:\n- url: \"https://claude.com/pricing\"\n- prompt: \"What does the Max Plan ($100 5x and $200 20x) include? Does it include API access or API credits? Is the 5x/20x quota for web/desktop/Claude Code only, or does it cover API usage too? Quote any text about API access.\""}]},"uuid":"2d4d94f3-ceb7-47cb-9d63-ebf1225cabcc","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:28:45.606Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"33b0cf04-290d-448e-8009-e809d2b146c3","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"a847414e-eab3-47da-b75c-550c5b9731fc","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"eebdff44-21ca-495a-a734-0853a773bea2","agentId":"abd0d088248413ba4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01R3FNBQBZiH1w2tDerERZAN","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Claude Opus 4.7 API pricing per million tokens input output 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Claude Opus 4.7 Pricing 2026: The Real Cost Story Behind the “Unchanged” Price Tag\",\"url\":\"https://www.finout.io/blog/claude-opus-4.7-pricing-the-real-cost-story-behind-the-unchanged-price-tag\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Opus 4.7 - API Pricing & Benchmarks | OpenRouter\",\"url\":\"https://openrouter.ai/anthropic/claude-opus-4.7\"},{\"title\":\"Pricing - Claude API Docs\",\"url\":\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Opus 4.7 Pricing In 2026: What It Actually Costs (And Whether It's Worth It)\",\"url\":\"https://www.cloudzero.com/blog/claude-opus-4-7-pricing/\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Opus 4.7 API Pricing 2026 - Costs, Performance & Providers\",\"url\":\"https://pricepertoken.com/pricing-page/model/anthropic-claude-opus-4.7\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic API Pricing in 2026: Complete Guide — Models, Caching, Batch & Optimization\",\"url\":\"https://www.finout.io/blog/anthropic-api-pricing\"},{\"title\":\"What are Claude Opus 4.7's pricing and token costs?\",\"url\":\"https://milvus.io/ai-quick-reference/what-are-claude-opus-47s-pricing-and-token-costs\"},{\"title\":\"Claude API Pricing: Haiku 4.5, Sonnet 4.6, and Opus 4.7 (April 2026) | BenchLM.ai\",\"url\":\"https://benchlm.ai/blog/posts/claude-api-pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Claude API Pricing 2026: Latest Anthropic Costs for Opus, Sonnet, Haiku\",\"url\":\"https://evolink.ai/blog/claude-api-pricing-guide-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Opus 4.7 Pricing Explained: Why the Same Token Rates Can Still Mean Higher Bills\",\"url\":\"https://nerova.ai/costs-roi/claude-opus-4-7-pricing-explained-2026\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's the pricing information for Claude Opus 4.7 API in 2026:\n\n## Claude Opus 4.7 API Pricing\n\nClaude Opus 4.7 costs $5 per million input tokens and $25 per million output tokens.\n\n### Pricing with Discounts\n\nThe model offers up to 90% savings with prompt caching and 50% with batch processing. More specifically:\n\n- **Prompt Caching**: Cache reads cost $0.50 per million input tokens (90% off)\n- **Batch Processing**: Batch processing cuts all rates by 50%, bringing costs down to $2.50 per million input tokens and $12.50 per million output tokens\n\n### Important Tokenizer Note\n\nOpus 4.7 ships with a new tokenizer that can produce up to 35% more tokens for the same input text, meaning your real bill per request can go up even though the rate card did not.\n\nThe pricing is identical to Opus 4.6, but the tokenizer change means that while the per-token rates remain the same, the effective cost per request may be higher depending on your content type.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"e157f34a-aaf3-43a2-a869-d7976ef9fea6","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:28:51.091Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a847414e-eab3-47da-b75c-550c5b9731fc","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"38f43678-77e6-427e-9ad6-777a542eca0b","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"eebdff44-21ca-495a-a734-0853a773bea2","agentId":"abd0d088248413ba4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015eciPDBaxPHHbPPLu7dS7E","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Anthropic Max plan 20x $200 include API credits API access 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"How to Use Claude AI for Free: All Options for Developers in 2026 - Verdent Guides\",\"url\":\"https://www.verdent.ai/guides/how-to-use-claude-ai-for-free-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code Pricing 2026: Pro, Max, API Costs Explained | Get AI Perks\",\"url\":\"https://www.getaiperks.com/en/ai/claude-code-pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic API Pricing in 2026: Complete Guide — Models, Caching, Batch & Optimization\",\"url\":\"https://www.finout.io/blog/anthropic-api-pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Pricing Explained: Subscription Plans & API Costs | IntuitionLabs\",\"url\":\"https://intuitionlabs.ai/articles/claude-pricing-plans-api-costs\"},{\"title\":\"OpenClaw + Claude Code Costs 2026: API Key vs Pro $20 vs Max $200 (After Subscription Cutoff)\",\"url\":\"https://www.shareuhack.com/en/posts/openclaw-claude-code-oauth-cost\"},{\"title\":\"Plans & Pricing | Claude by Anthropic\",\"url\":\"https://claude.com/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code Pricing (2026): Plans, Costs, and Free Tier Explained | How Do I Use AI\",\"url\":\"https://www.howdoiuseai.com/blog/2026-04-16-claude-code-pricing-2026-plans-costs-and-free-tier\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code Pricing 2026: Free Credits, API Costs & Max Plan Explained | NxCode\",\"url\":\"https://www.nxcode.io/resources/news/claude-code-pricing-2026-free-api-costs-max-plan\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic Offers Free Usage Credits to Celebrate New Bundles — Up to $200 for Pro and Team Plans\",\"url\":\"https://www.agent-wars.com/news/2026-04-04-anthropic-free-usage-credits-promotion\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic Gives Claude Pro, Max, and Team Subscribers Free ...\",\"url\":\"https://megaoneai.com/analysis/anthropic-gives-claude-pro-max-and-team-subscribers-free-usage-credits-up-to-200/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Anthropic's Max plan at $200 and related API information:\n\n## Claude Max 20x Plan ($200/month)\n\nAnthropic's Max 20x is the highest-tier plan at $200 per month, and Max 20x is 20x Pro's quota for Claude Code usage.\n\n## API Credits and Access\n\nIt's important to note a key distinction: A Pro or Max subscription gives access to claude.ai — not the API. API usage is always billed per token. Teams building on Claude pay for both independently.\n\nHowever, there are API credit opportunities available:\n- New API users receive a small amount of free credits to test the API. Anthropic doesn't publish the exact amount, but third-party sources report it as approximately $5 in credits.\n- Max 20x subscribers can receive $200 in extra usage credits as a one-time promotional offer.\n\n## Open Source Program\n\nThe Claude for Open Source program gives qualifying open source maintainers six months of Claude Max 20x — Anthropic's highest-tier plan at $200 per month — completely free, with a total value of $1,200.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"3b460a06-f4ff-4813-aca7-e95000f5f0a9","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:28:51.537Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"38f43678-77e6-427e-9ad6-777a542eca0b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"512f86c9-3408-4371-b1a9-42e8ea95af7b","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"eebdff44-21ca-495a-a734-0853a773bea2","agentId":"abd0d088248413ba4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0133JgbRiw6Y7LFAjM7GGXwe","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Claude Max subscription API key console.anthropic.com same account\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Use Claude Code with your Pro or Max plan | Claude Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/11145838-use-claude-code-with-your-pro-or-max-plan\"},{\"title\":\"I have a paid Claude subscription (Pro, Max, Team, or Enterprise plans). Why do I have to pay separately to use the Claude API and Console? | Claude Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/9876003-i-have-a-paid-claude-subscription-pro-max-team-or-enterprise-plans-why-do-i-have-to-pay-separately-to-use-the-claude-api-and-console\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code API Key vs Subscription Billing: Which Route Should You Use? | LaoZhang AI Blog\",\"url\":\"https://blog.laozhang.ai/en/posts/claude-code-api-key-vs-subscription-billing\"},{\"title\":\"Claude, Claude API, and Claude Code: What's the Difference?\",\"url\":\"https://eval.16x.engineer/blog/claude-vs-claude-api-vs-claude-code\"},{\"title\":\"How to Get Your Claude (Anthropic) API Key\",\"url\":\"https://www.apideck.com/blog/how-to-get-your-claude-anthropic-api-key\"},{\"title\":\"How to Switch from Anthropic API Key to Claude Pro/Max/Team Subscription in Claude Code\",\"url\":\"https://codenote.net/en/posts/claude-code-anthropic-api-key-to-subscription/\"},{\"title\":\"Authentication - Claude Code Docs\",\"url\":\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/authentication\"},{\"title\":\"[BUG] Claude Code for Desktop always shows \\\"Claude API Account\\\" instead of subscription account (NOT caused by API key) · Issue #12383 · anthropics/claude-code\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/12383\"},{\"title\":\"[BUG] Claude Code defaults to API key billing despite active Max subscription · Issue #44669 · anthropics/claude-code\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/44669\"},{\"title\":\"How to get your Claude API key: A step-by-step guide (2026) | Pickaxe Blog\",\"url\":\"https://pickaxe.co/post/how-to-get-your-claude-api-key-a-step-by-step-guide\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Claude Max subscriptions, API keys, and console.anthropic.com on the same account:\n\n## Key Points\n\n**Separate Products:** The Claude Console is the developer platform providing API keys and access to Claude models for building applications and integrations, while a paid Claude subscription enhances your chat experience but doesn't include access to the Claude API or Console.\n\n**Same Account, Different Billing:** If you're interested in both enhanced chat features and API access, you'll need to sign up for a paid Claude plan and separately set up Console access for API usage, allowing you to benefit from both offerings based on your specific needs.\n\n**Claude Code with Subscriptions:** With Pro and Max plans, you now have access to both Claude on the web, desktop, and mobile apps and Claude Code in your terminal with one unified subscription. However, if you have an ANTHROPIC_API_KEY environment variable set on your system, Claude Code will use this API key for authentication instead of your Claude subscription, resulting in API usage charges.\n\n**Authentication Priority:** If you have an active Claude subscription but also have ANTHROPIC_API_KEY set in your environment, the API key takes precedence once approved.\n\n**Where to Get API Keys:** In the left sidebar of the console, click Settings → API keys (or go directly to console.anthropic.com/settings/keys).\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"23028c05-7377-458b-89d8-c4940bc14cb1","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:28:53.418Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"512f86c9-3408-4371-b1a9-42e8ea95af7b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
